sequenceDiagram
  participant Tx as MongoDB transaction
  participant O as Outbox
  participant P as Publisher
  participant K as MSK
  participant C as Idempotent consumer
  Tx->>O: Commit fact and pending event atomically
  P->>O: Claim pending event
  P->>K: Publish event with stable delivery key
  K-->>C: At-least-once delivery
  C->>C: Check delivery idempotency
  C->>C: Run named follow-up action
